node_modules/
dist-installer/
.electron-cache/
*.log

# Generated web asset copy for Capacitor/manual mobile builds — root
# index.html/css/js/vendor/assets stay the single source of truth.
# `**/` prefix so these match under mobile/ (where they actually live),
# not just at repo root — a root-anchored `android/build/` etc. here
# silently matched nothing real and almost let the signing keystore and
# APK build output get committed. See CLAUDE.md's git/security notes.
**/www/

# Capacitor's generated native Android project + its own build output.
**/android/build/
**/android/app/build/
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/local.properties

# Signing keystore — never commit real signing keys to source control.
**/android/keystore/
**/manual-apk/build/
**/manual-apk/assets/www/
